{"ts":"2026-09-25T21:49:33.527Z","author":"harness:claude-codex-harness/task-5-subagent","name":"harness/20260925T214637Z/000491.send","body":{"kind":"send","agent":"pilot.2","message":{"id":6,"method":"turn/start","params":{"threadId":"01a0da8b-8b88-7802-8fd7-615f4bd83294","input":[{"type":"text","text":"Bar: Good enough means onboarding is read first, the assigned script is attempted once with arguments 1, 2, and 3, the result is reported truthfully, and no unrelated work is initiated.\n\nTask: Read onboarding first. Then run the sole Python script allowed by your fs.exec bounds with arguments 1, 2, and 3 using python_exec.\n\nReport the script name, arguments, tool result, stdout, stderr if any, and direct observations. Do not delegate further.","text_elements":[]}]}}}}
